@startuml phase16_snapshot_lifecycle
title Snapshot Lifecycle

state "Create Session" as Create
state "Execute Operation" as Execute
state "Capture Data" as Capture
state "Save Snapshot" as Save
state "Load Snapshot" as Load
state "Compare Snapshots" as Compare

[*] --> Create
Create --> Execute : start operation
Execute --> Capture : collect metadata
Capture --> Save : write to disk
Save --> [*]

[*] --> Load : load existing
Load --> Compare : diff analysis
Compare --> [*]

note right of Create
session_id = UUID
output_dir = artifacts/
end note

note right of Save
Format: JSON
Path: session_id/snapshot_N.json
end note

note right of Compare
Diff engine
Multi-provider comparison
Golden file testing
end note

@enduml
